{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうすぐ乃木のの始まるよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に本当に\n自分の体調管理の行き届いてない感じ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"反省してます..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただ、\n中田'16 が生まれた乃木ののですもんね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田'16 最後の出演です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さよなら 中田'16"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/25/5179698/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"18:00〜18:30\n文化放送「乃木坂46の『の』」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"良かったら聴いてね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/25/5179698/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は\nミュージックソンに\n出演させていただきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/25/5179698/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結構、遅い時間だったのに\n電話ありがとうございました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生の声が聞けるって\nすごいいいですよね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんのお話を聞いて改めて\n目の不自由な方たちのためになることが\n私に少しでもできたらなって思いました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しくて面白いラジオを届ける事が\n私ができる事の中で\n今、一番早く実現しやすい事なんじゃないかなって思うから\nもっともっと頑張りたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/25/5179698/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"途中でまいちゅんが電話受付してたので\nちょっとだけ伊織と2人でラジオしたけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パーソナリティ席とか初めて座ったから\nなんかど緊張しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/25/5179698/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも楽しかったー！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にラジオたくさん出れて嬉しい！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聴きそびれた方は\n今からでもタイムフリーで聴いてみてね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/25/5179698/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}